  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting energy reforms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives of this assignment are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Effective energy policy and strategic framework in place, duly implemented and monitored&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;National legislation aligned with the EU Energy acquis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Institutional capacities for implementation and enforcement of the legislation strengthened.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
